# Map hostnames used by ssh to their addresses.
# Entries are production server names only (there is no member-machine ssh).
# This file is private data, kept in the private config repo and injected into
# etc/ by fetch-private-data via .private-source (see doc/system/private-config.md).
# It feeds two dev-machine conveniences: the /etc/hosts merge (make dev-init)
# and the generated ~/.ssh/config.d/simox.conf (`ssh simox-<name>`).
# Format: ip-address  hostname
# Example:
# 192.168.1.100	my-server
